 An order-one source with sixty-four genuinely distinct conditional
 distributions: each context draws from its own six-byte alphabet, so the
 contexts cluster into more than four groups and a fifth tree onwards has real
 work to do.

 THE THRESHOLD SITS BETWEEN TWO MEASURED NUMBERS: 5662 bytes capped at four
 literal trees, 5480 with eight available. Eight trees need the context map to
 carry a COMPLEX prefix code -- the format's simple code names at most four
 symbols -- and a complex code cannot describe a flat alphabet, which is why the
 cap existed. It does not need solving: an even map fails its own space check,
 that tree count loses the costing, and a smaller k is used.

